OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers killed in
OL,4,Awrong-way crash mourned in
OL,5,A'unimaginable loss'
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo police officers killed in a
OL,8,Fwrong-way crash on the A66 near
OL,9,FMiddlesbrough have been remembered as
OL,10,F"brave officers protecting our
OL,11,Fcommunities" in what has been described
OL,12,Fas an "unimaginable loss".
OL,14,FPC Matthew Blades, 37, and PC Tom
OL,15,FClough, 38, were killed when a
OL,16,FVolkswagen Passat with five occupants
OL,17,Fsaid to be in their late teens to early
OL,18,F20s, driving the wrong way, struck the
OL,19,FCleveland Police vehicle at about 03:39
OL,20,FBST on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
