OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officers killed in
OL,4,Awrong-way crash mourned in
OL,5,A'unimaginable loss'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe teens, who were also killed, have
OL,8,Fnot been named.
OL,10,FThe BBC understands a police pursuit of
OL,11,Fthe car had ended before the crash,
OL,12,Fwith the police vehicle just happening
OL,13,Fto be in the South Bank area.
